  "changelog": "- Initial release of the geoskill-idw-interpolation tool for spatial interpolation using the Inverse Distance Weighting (IDW) method.\n- Supports power parameter adjustment, search radius limits, and nearest-neighbor search.\n- Provides both synthetic (simulated data) and real data modes.\n- Outputs results as GeoTIFF/GeoJSON/JSON raster files with a run manifest.\n- Fully offline operation with no external data or network requests; local computation only.\n- Includes clear usage instructions, dependencies, and privacy statement (MIT License).",
